,"Distributed And Hybrid Cache"]],"\n",["P",{},"A distributed cache is shared over the network by service replicas. A hybrid\ncache combines per-instance L1 with shared L2."],"\n","\n",["P",{},"L1 avoids network latency and shields hot keys. L2 shares warm values after\nrestart and across replicas. The cost is two expiration/invalidation layers and\na larger possible staleness window. Adopt hybrid caching only when measurements\nshow that remote-cache latency or hot-key pressure justifies it."],"\n",["H2",{"class":"anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq","id":"read-algorithm"},"Read Algorithm",["A",{"href":"#read-algorithm","class":"hash-link","aria-label":"Direct link to Read Algorithm","title":"Direct link to Read Algorithm","translate":"no"},"​"]],"\n",["DIV",{"class":"language-java codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block","style":"--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"},["DIV",{"class":"codeBlockContent_QJqH"},["PRE",{"tabindex":"0","class":"prism-code language-java codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar","style":"color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"},["CODE",{"class":"codeBlockLines_e6Vv"},["DIV",{"class":"token-line","style":"color:#393A34"},["SPAN",{"class":"token class-name"},"Product"],["SPAN",{"class":"token plain"}," "],["SPAN",{"class":"token function","style":"color:#d73a49"},"findProduct"],["SPAN",{"class":"token punctuation","style":"color:#393A34"},"("],["SPAN",{"class":"token class-name"},"ProductId"],["SPAN",{"class":"token plain"}," id"],["SPAN",{"class":"token punctuation","style":"color:#393A34"},")"],["SPAN",{"class":"token plain"}," "],["SPAN",{"class":"token punctuation","style":"color:#393A34"},"{"],["SPAN",{"class":"token plain"}],["BR"]],["DIV",{"class":"token-line","style":"color:#393A34"},["SPAN",{"class":"token plain"},"    "],["SPAN",{"class":"token class-name"},"Product"],["SPAN",{"class":"token plain"}," local "],["SPAN",{"class":"token operator","style":"color:#393A34"},"="],["SPAN",{"class":"token plain"}," l1"],["SPAN",{