3A34"},["SPAN",{"class":"token plain"},"                "],["SPAN",{"class":"token punctuation","style":"color:#393A34"},")"],["SPAN",{"class":"token punctuation","style":"color:#393A34"},","],["SPAN",{"class":"token plain"}],["BR"]],["DIV",{"class":"token-line","style":"color:#393A34"},["SPAN",{"class":"token plain"},"                serviceId"],["BR"]],["DIV",{"class":"token-line","style":"color:#393A34"},["SPAN",{"class":"token plain"},"        "],["SPAN",{"class":"token punctuation","style":"color:#393A34"},")"],["SPAN",{"class":"token punctuation","style":"color:#393A34"},";"],["SPAN",{"class":"token plain"}],["BR"]],["DIV",{"class":"token-line","style":"color:#393A34"},["SPAN",{"class":"token plain"},"    "],["SPAN",{"class":"token punctuation","style":"color:#393A34"},"}"],["SPAN",{"class":"token plain"}],["BR"]],["DIV",{"class":"token-line","style":"color:#393A34"},["SPAN",{"class":"token plain"}],["SPAN",{"class":"token punctuation","style":"color:#393A34"},"}"],["BR"]]]]]],"\n",["P",{},"Attach it to a client with service-specific load-balancer configuration. Use a\ncustom algorithm only when measurements justify the additional behavior."],"\n",["H2",{"class":"anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq","id":"retry-interaction"},"Retry Interaction",["A",{"href":"#retry-interaction","class":"hash-link","aria-label":"Direct link to Retry Interaction","title":"Direct link to Retry Interaction","translate":"no"},"​"]],"\n",["P",{},"A load balancer selects an instance; retry decides whether another attempt is\nallowed. Important rules:"],"\n",["UL",{},"\n",["LI",{"class":""},"retry only safe or idempotent operations;"],"\n",["LI",{"class":""},"use a strict attempt and time budget;"],"\n",["LI",{"class":""},"avoid retry storms when many clients see the same outage;"],"\n",["LI",{"class":""},"prefer another healthy instance when retrying connection failures;"],"\n",["LI",{"class":""},"do not hide a system-wide outage behind long retries;"],"\n",["LI",{"class":""},"coordinate gateway, Feign, and service-level retry counts."],"\n"],"\n",["H2",{"class":"anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq","id":"shopverse-implementation"},"Shopverse Implementation",["A",{"href":"#shopverse-implementation","class":"hash-link","aria-label":"Direct link to Shopverse Implementation","title":"Direct link to Shopverse Implementation","translate":"no"},"​"]],"\n",["P",{},"Shopverse currently uses:"],"\n",["UL",{},"\n",["LI",{"class":""},"Eureka as the service registry;"],"\n",["LI",{"class":""},["CODE",{},"lb://SERVICE-NAME"]," routes in API Gateway;"],"\n",["LI",{"class":""},"logical service names in Feign clients;"],"\n",["LI",{"class":""},"Spring Cloud LoadBalancer integration;"],"\n",["LI",{"class":""},"stateless service instances at the application layer;"],"\n",["LI",{"class":""},"circuit-breaker and bounded ",["CODE",{},"GET"]," retry behavior at the gateway."],"\n"],"\n","\n",["P",{},"The local Docker Compose POC normally runs one instance of each service, so\ninstance distribution is not visibly demonstrated until additional replicas\nregister under the same application name."],"\n",["P",{},"Shopverse does not currently define a custom load-balancing algorithm,\nweighted instances, sticky sessions, or consistent hashing."],"\n",["H2",{"class":"anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq","id":"production-practices"},"Production Practices",["A",{"href":"#production-practices","class":"hash-link","aria-label":"Direct link to Production Practices","title":"Direct link to Production Practices","translate":"no"},"​"]],"\n",["OL",{},"\n",["LI",{"class":""},"Make services stateless where practical."],"\n",["LI",{"class":""},"use readiness and graceful shutdown."],"\n",["LI",{"class":""},"keep discovery caches bounded and observable."],"\n",["LI",{"class":""},"set connection and response timeouts."],"\n",["LI",{"class":""},"coordinate retries with ",["A",{"title":"Glossary: idempotency","class":"","href":"/shopverse/reference/GLOSSARY#idempotency"},"idempotency"]," and deadlines."],"\n",["LI",{"class":""},"monitor instance count, selection failures, latency, and error rate."],"\n",["LI",{"class":""},"avoid sticky sessions unless the state model requires them."],"\n",["LI",{"class":""},"account for unequal instance capacity before using plain Round Robin."],"\n",["LI",{"class":""},"protect the registry and service network."],"\n",["LI",{"class":""},"test instance loss, scale-out, draining, and rolling deployment."],"\n"],"\n",["H2",{"class":"anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq","id":"related-guides"},"Related Guides",["A",{"href":"#related-guides","class":"hash-link","aria-label":"Direct link to Related Guides","title":"Direct link to Related Guides","translate":"no"},"​"]],"\n",["UL",{},"\n",["LI",{"class":""},["A",{"class":"","href":"/shopverse/architecture/SERVICE-DISCOVERY"},"Service Discovery"]],"\n",["LI",{"class":""},["A",{"class":"","href":"/shopverse/development/API-GATEWAY-GENERIC"},"API Gateway"]],"\n",["LI",{"class":""},["A",{"class":"","href":"/shopverse/spring/SPRING-OPENFEIGN"},"Spring Cloud OpenFeign"]],"\n",["LI",{"class":""},["A",{"class":"","href":"/shopverse/architecture/SYSTEM-DESIGN"},"System design"]],"\n",["LI",{"class":""},["A",{"class":"","href":"/shopverse/reliability/RESILIENCE4J"},"Resilience4j"]],"\n"]]],["ASIDE",{"class":"feedback_Abhk","aria-label":"Documentation feedback"},["DIV",{},["STRONG",{},"Help improve this guide"],["SPAN",{},"Share the page or tell us what is unclear, outdated, or missing."]],["DIV",{"class":"actions_wZJ4"},["BUTTON",{"type":"button"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-copy","aria-hidden":"true"},["rect",{"width":"14","height":"14","x":"8","y":"8","rx":"2","ry":"2"}],["path",{"d":"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"}]],"Copy link"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button"}